  "details": "As said in above title.\nThe default binding for safe mode panic toggle needs to be remapped for index controllers.\n\nDue to the constant gripping/resting on of the controllers and buttons i and many others keep accidentally setting off the safe mode system.\n\nIts just way to easy to activate with out the controllers work.\nMaybe setting it to actual menu button and trigger instead of B+Trigger.",
